<title>ARGENTINA: Bansud issues $30 mln short-term debt.</title>
<headline>Bansud issues $30 mln short-term debt.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Bansud said Tuesday it was issuing $30 million in corporate bonds as part of its $400 million short-term debt program.</p>
<p>It said the bonds would mature in 360 days from the Jan. 28 issue date. The issue is totally subscribed by Sud Bank &amp; Trust Company Ltd.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
</text>
